step Loch Modan + quick Badlands hop
  zone map 1418
  tip Ride to Stonewrought Dam, jump down onto the ledge with the Carved Figurine · Hand in: Wet Job at the Carved Figurine · reward Hickory Pipe + Rumsey Rum Light
  turnin 1106 "Martek the Exiled" @42.2,52.7 -- Badlands · Martek the Exiled (42.2, 52.7)
  task "Cozy Sleeping Bag · step 5 (Wet Job → Eagle's Fist)" optional
  accept 92743 "A Conqueror's Crown" npc 5398 "Warug" map 1443 @75.0,68.2

step A Conqueror's Crown
  zone map 1418
  tip Quick hop while you're in Loch Modan: run south from Thelsamar through the gate into Badlands · Crypt is just NE of Ryedol's dwarf camp, loot the Conqueror's Helm inside · The Mummies library book is in the same crypt, grab it now and tick it off later in the Badlands stop · Run back to Thelsamar and carry on to Arathi, keep the helm in your bags
  complete 92743 "A Conqueror's Crown"
  note Keep it: you hand this in later on the route.

